{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02342","headline":"杂歌谣辞 李夫人歌 · 李贺","name":"杂歌谣辞 李夫人歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫皇宫殿重重开，夫人飞入琼瑶台。\n绿香绣帐何时歇，青云无光宫水咽。\n翩联桂花坠秋月，孤鸾惊啼商丝发。\n红璧阑珊悬佩璫，歌台小妓遥相望。\n玉蟾滴水鸡人唱，露华兰叶参差光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}